WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.200
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.300
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.601
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:07.934
President Biden
spoke today in Illinois

00:00:07.934 --> 00:00:10.667
about his administration's
plan to support farmers.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.000
Although, I feel like
he should be

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.400
asking about their plan
to support him.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.767
"Do you guys got one of those
Charlotte's Web spiders

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:20.367
that could write
something nice about me?"

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:23.968
While speaking yesterday at
The White House

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:26.300
about the steps
he's taking to curb inflation,

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.033
President Biden
acknowledged that Democrats

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:31.000
"control all three branches
of the government."

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.434
Oh, so you are aware.

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.534
It's like hearing 6-year-old say

00:00:36.534 --> 00:00:38.634
Genesis was better with
Peter Gabriel.

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:40.868
Definitely.

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:44.367
We just didn't know you knew.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:47.300
Bill Gates announced yesterday
that he has tested positive for

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.133
a breakthrough case of
the coronavirus.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:51.400
Gates says
he probably got the virus

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.133
because he forgot to
install McAfee.

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:02.667
That's right -- Bill Gates has
tested positive for coronavirus.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:05.467
So for now, he's just going to
attend meetings on Zoom.

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:08.434
Oh, I mean, Microsoft Teams!

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:12.534
We all -- We love
Microsoft Teams, everybody.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.634
A House intelligence
subcommittee is set, next week,

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:19.501
to hold the first open
Congressional hearing on UFOs.

00:01:19.501 --> 00:01:20.767
Oh, come on.

00:01:20.767 --> 00:01:24.300
How many times are you
going to make him testify?

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:28.968
According to newly released
audio from an interview

00:01:28.968 --> 00:01:30.300
after the Capitol attack,

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.033
Republican Senator
Lindsey Graham

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:34.400
praised President Biden
and said he's the

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.868
"best person to have in office."

00:01:36.868 --> 00:01:38.000
And then today, he said,

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.734
"I'm gonna let that go
to voicemail."

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:44.701
Actor James Cromwell
superglued himself

00:01:44.701 --> 00:01:47.167
to the counter of a Starbucks
in New York yesterday

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:50.334
to protest the chain charging
more for plant-based milks,

00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:51.534
while over at Dunkin',

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:55.501
you kind of just stick to
the counter naturally.

00:01:57.234 --> 00:01:59.167
Thank you very much.

00:02:11.701 --> 00:02:14.667
Two unoccupied beach houses
in North Carolina

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.334
recently fell into the ocean,

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:22.000
or, as the Realtor put it,
360-degree ocean views.

00:02:24.267 --> 00:02:26.701
A rat ran onto the field
during last night's

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:27.934
New York Mets game.

00:02:27.934 --> 00:02:30.734
A staff member quickly caught it
and, out of habit,

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:33.200
tossed it to a kid in
the front row.

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:42.167
"Hi, baseball rat!

00:02:42.167 --> 00:02:44.534
I got a baseball rat!"

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:49.033
And, finally, an alligator
was recently spotted

00:02:49.033 --> 00:02:50.767
in the drive-through of
a fast-food restaurant

00:02:50.767 --> 00:02:52.100
in North Carolina.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:56.267
But this is annoying.
He had no idea what he wanted.

00:02:56.267 --> 00:02:59.067
"Let's go!

00:02:59.067 --> 00:03:01.267
Let's go!
You're holding up the line!"

00:03:01.267 --> 00:03:03.300
And that was a monologue.
[ Laughs ]

